
# Privacy Policy

_Last updated: {{DATE}}_

This Privacy Policy explains how CollectorConnector (“we”, “us”) collects, uses, and shares your personal data when you use our website and services (“Service”). We act as a “controller” under UK data protection law (UK GDPR and Data Protection Act 2018).

## 1. Data we collect
- **Account data:** name, email, username, profile info, social links.
- **Content data:** images and descriptions you upload.
- **Technical data:** IP address, device, browser, approximate location, log data.
- **Usage data:** pages viewed, actions taken.
- **Cookies and similar technologies:** see our Cookie Policy.

## 2. How we use your data (lawful bases)
- To provide and operate the Service (contract).
- To secure, maintain, and improve the Service (legitimate interests).
- To communicate with you about service updates (legitimate interests/contract).
- To comply with legal obligations.

## 3. Sharing and processors
We use trusted processors to host and operate the Service, such as:
- **Hosting and deployment:** e.g., Vercel
- **Database and storage:** e.g., Supabase
- **Analytics:** e.g., privacy‑respecting analytics or other tools (if used)

We have data processing agreements in place with these vendors. We do not sell your personal data.

## 4. International transfers
Where data is transferred outside the UK/EEA, we rely on appropriate safeguards (e.g., Standard Contractual Clauses). Details available on request.

## 5. Data retention
We keep personal data only as long as necessary for the purposes described or as required by law. You may request deletion of your account and associated personal data.

## 6. Your rights
You have rights to access, rectify, erase, restrict or object to processing, and data portability. To exercise your rights, contact us at {{PRIVACY EMAIL}}. You may also complain to the UK ICO (https://ico.org.uk/).

## 7. Security
We implement reasonable technical and organisational measures, including access controls, encryption in transit, and least‑privilege configurations. No system is 100% secure.

## 8. Children
The Service is not directed to children under 13. If you believe a child has provided personal data, contact us and we will take appropriate steps.

## 9. Changes
We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. We will post updates with a new “Last updated” date.

